/- Pure analytic certification of the unchanged actual I10.
Exact substitution u = 1-(6/11)/(3/4-x), x ∈ [0,15/116], reverses the
original endpoints. Put y=x+1/4 and r=(44/9)x. Then y≤2/5, r≤55/87.
Fixed choices made before evaluating the endpoint: log expansion n=12,
geometric remainder degree 48. Their entire-interval majorants are
L=2∑_{k<12}y^(2k+1)/(2k+1)+(50/21)y^25 and
G=(44/9)(∑_{k<48}r^k+(87/32)r^48).
H is the exact rational primitive of L*G. All identities, remainder
inequalities, endpoint arithmetic, and the integral change are proved below.
No quadrature, degree search, sampled point inference, or floating arithmetic.
-/

